WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
Who do you see when you look at Liverpool?

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.780
Can you see the one?

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.900
Do you see the thousands of people
who don't know Jesus?

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.360
We're surrounded by people
from across the world.

5
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.960
How many know Jesus and who he really is?

6
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:18.500
How many have the opportunity to
experience a community of Christians

7
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.780
living out faith in him?

8
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:26.540
We believe that God has given us a vision
for a vibrant city centre church

9
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.400
that is for Liverpool
and is loving the whole world.

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.720
And we have a dream for a building of
our own in the heart of the city.

11
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.640
We've been on this journey
now for 20 years.

12
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:45.440
Since we began in 2003, the idea behind
the church has remained the same:

13
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:50.920
most people have not rejected the gospel,
they've just not heard and experienced it.

14
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:56.480
Here in the UK our church grouping, the
FIEC, have done research that suggests

15
00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:01.740
less than 3% of people have any meaningful
connection with any church at all.

16
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.340
And Liverpool is a place just like that.

17
00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.860
Many people disconnected from church,
but not against it.

18
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.180
They've just not experienced it.

19
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:17.340
So we thought, you can have a church where
people really understand the Bible

20
00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:17.860
for themselves,

21
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:24.500
where people can ask any question and
receive a good answer, where people can

22
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:28.680
experience the best things there are to
experience of our Christian community.

23
00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:35.440
And a church where people, if they want to
be, can be invested in and trained and

24
00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.220
sent out into the world.

25
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.860
Within a year of our church starting we'd
outgrown our venue, which held a hundred

26
00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:47.220
people, and since then we've continued to
grow — not only our church, but starting or

27
00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:51.580
revitalising six new churches in
Liverpool and the North West region.

28
00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.120
And the story goes on.

29
00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:59.860
Lives are being changed, churches are
being revitalised, God is at work.

30
00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.680
We praise God for his amazing grace
towards us, and for all he's done

31
00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.340
through us over the years,
and all he's doing now.

32
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:14.280
God is using us in our Sunday services and
ministries, through the sharing of our

33
00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.300
lives as we meet together
in small groups across the city,

34
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.820
and through the sharing of our faith.

35
00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:25.640
It is such a joy to see so many people of
different ages, backgrounds and

36
00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:31.120
nationalities being baptised, being
discipled and growing in their faith.

37
00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.400
We long to see this more and more.

38
00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:40.280
We want to invite the thousands of people
in Liverpool to come and experience our

39
00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.600
church community,
to come and meet Jesus Christ.

40
00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:49.520
We want to continue to grow, but for a
number of years we've been limited by not

41
00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:50.580
having our own building.

42
00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:57.180
We're not able to welcome more people,
and we long for more freedom

43
00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.220
with the space we have.

44
00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.080
Being tenants and not owners
is highly restrictive,

45
00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.500
it's inefficient and it's insecure.

46
00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.560
We've struggled with our location.

47
00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:13.880
We really want to be a much more
accessible and visible presence in the city.

48
00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:19.640
Having our Sunday services and midweek
events in different venues can be unclear

49
00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.400
and unhelpful.

50
00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:26.240
It is our dream to have a home of our own
in the heart of the city.

51
00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:33.180
Imagine a place where we can do everything
under one roof, a place which is

52
00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:36.240
multifunctional, spacious and welcoming.

53
00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:42.260
Imagine the freedom we would have as we
run our church services, events,

54
00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.760
ministries — and even do more.

55
00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:49.920
Imagine a building or a site
that lets us grow, so we can reach

56
00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:55.880
the thousands of people, disciple, train
and send them back into our great city.

57
00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.340
This is our dream.

58
00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.420
Imagine a place like this, a place that's
a visible, accessible home to welcome

59
00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.300
people in.

60
00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:08.220
Not for comfort,
but to be gathered and sent out.

61
00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:13.840
A secure hub in which we can disciple,
train and send out the future leaders.

62
00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:20.740
A solid foundation to plant and revitalise
many churches for decades to come.

63
00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:25.920
We believe that this is the church that
Liverpool, the wider region and the UK

64
00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.740
desperately needs.

65
00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.280
But we're not there yet.

66
00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.760
We still face many challenges.

67
00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:38.260
But we believe God has led us to this
point, and we confidently trust in him for

68
00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.340
every step that remains.

69
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.060
We need your help.

70
00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:48.700
Will you consider partnering with us by
faithfully praying, widely sharing, and

71
00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.480
generously giving?

72
00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:55.580
Your generosity will help us secure this
building and turn it into a home that

73
00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.080
truly serves Liverpool and beyond.

74
00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:05.040
Our city has hundreds of thousands who are
hungry for community, for

75
00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:05.480
belonging,

76
00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.020
for meaning.

77
00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.920
Many are searching and open to Jesus.

78
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:17.360
We believe that God will use this home to
reach them, grow his church and

79
00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.980
bring glory to his name.

80
00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.580
And we'd love for you to be
a part of this exciting project.
